<title>THAILAND: American Standard sets H1 dividend.</title>
<headline>American Standard sets H1 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  14.25   vs    17.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 October 10, 1996</p>
<p>    Payment date	October 28, 1996</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is American Standard Sanitaryware (Thailand) Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
